{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Soulo 是一款適用於 iPhone 與 iPad 的多重搜尋瀏覽器，只需輸入一次查詢，即可在搜尋、社交、影片、購物、知識與 AI 平台之間自由切換，無需重複輸入相同字詞。它同時整合分頁管理、媒體下載與電子書閱讀，適合經常跨平台查找資料、觀看影片或整理檔案的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-99.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>跨平台搜尋與媒體管理</h2>\n<p>開啟應用後，常用分頁與網站群組會優先顯示，重啟後仍保留最近使用次序。內建廣告過濾與私密瀏覽，並可為個別網站設定追蹤保護。播放影片時支援速度調整、子母畫面與背景播放，亦可偵測網頁上的影片、音訊與圖片並下載。另提供壓縮檔解壓與電子書閱讀。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-109-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-110-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-111-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-112-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-113-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-114-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Soulo: Multi-Search Browser</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/soulo-multi-search-browser/id6761165330?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T00:21:30.444861+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T00:08:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T00:58:43.816425+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T00:18:26.590065+00:00","content_hash":"5df387042fab56388cc42ec2ba37ce931a291751c7478adc82691643f0bf427f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}